562	
563	    /** The claim's number on its sheet, given when it is opened: sheet-wide (1, 2, ...), or within its period
564	     *  (P1-1, or X-1 in no period) while the sheet numbers per period; none while a draft. A void claim keeps
565	     *  the number it had, and that number is never given again. */
566	    @Column(name = "claim_number")
